flowchart TD
    %% INPUT
    U([User<br/>natural-language request]) --> G1[Input guardrail<br/>validate and sanitize]
    G1 -- invalid --> ERR[Safe error message]

    %% RETRIEVAL
    G1 -- valid --> RET[Retriever<br/>search catalog and genre/mood notes]
    SONGS[(data/songs.csv)] --> RET
    KB[(Genre and mood<br/>knowledge base)] --> RET

    %% GENERATION
    RET -- retrieved context --> LLM[LLM recommender<br/>Claude picks, ranks, explains]
    LLM -- API failure --> FB[Fallback<br/>rule-based scorer]
    SONGS --> FB

    %% CHECKING
    LLM --> G2[Output guardrail<br/>songs must exist in catalog]
    G2 -- hallucinated song --> FB
    G2 -- verified --> SC[Scoring engine<br/>re-rank and cross-check]
    FB --> OUT
    SC --> OUT([Ranked recommendations<br/>with explanations])

    %% LOGGING
    G1 -.-> LOG[(logs/<br/>structured run log)]
    RET -.-> LOG
    LLM -.-> LOG
    G2 -.-> LOG

    %% TESTING AND HUMAN REVIEW
    EVAL[Evaluator<br/>fixed test queries, consistency and accuracy report] -. runs system .-> G1
    EVAL --> REP[Eval report]
    UT[pytest unit tests] -. verifies .-> SC
    OUT --> H{{Human review<br/>user checks results and gives feedback}}
    REP --> H
    H -. adjust weights, prompts, knowledge base .-> KB
